WEBVTT

﻿1

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.110
I have always believed that...


00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:41.580
...each one of us definitely has a duty.


00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:48.980
Each and every one has his own
strength and talent.


00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.820
And there is a place for him
to display those to the fullest.


00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:57.670
Each and every one has his own
strength and talent.


00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.940
"Experience in job interviews"


00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.560
...for him
to display those to the fullest.


00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.400
I am convinced that to me,


00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:07.370
that place is your respected company.


00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.840
Isn't that... Katou?


00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.170
Hey, he fell down.


00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:12.830
"The train on line number 2 will arrive
in a moment."


00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:14.980
What? The train's coming.


00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:18.140
"Please stand behind the yellow line."


00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:21.910
Someone! Call the train station staff.


00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:25.810
Seriously. Call them quickly.


00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.160
I can do this.


00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.290
The train's coming. Hey!


00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.360
Uncle, are you alright?


00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.170
Hey, are you alright?


00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:45.310
Hey!


00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.210
Sorry, can someone come down here
and give me a hand?


00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:50.340
He's drunk.


00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.340
Hey! Get a hold of yourself!


00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.980
Anyone will do.


00:02:58.650 --> 00:02:59.680
Kei-chan?


00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.250
You're Kei-chan right?


00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.190
Help me out here.


00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.460
Damn it!


00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.200
Hey! Get a hold of yourself!


00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.070
Hang in there!


00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.640
Over here!


00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.180
Ready go! Alright!


00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:39.860
Katou!


00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:40.620
Sorry.


00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.760
Huh?


00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.030
Eh?


00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.660
Someone's come again.


00:04:55.080 --> 00:05:00.390
Translated by yuizaki_libra@livejournal
Raw provided by bittersweet_bun@ourhour


00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.180
Huh?


00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:38.080
Tokyo Tower huh?


00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.380
It won't open.


00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.510
None of them does.


00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:54.390
What the heck is this place?
A hospital?


00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.720
Dunno.


00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:00.760
Hey.


00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.130
On the platform earlier...


00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.240
We were run over right?


00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:06.270
Did you ignore me?


00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:11.070
No- my bad, my bad.
Um... I didn't know it was you at first.


00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:15.640
Right? There's no way
Kei-chan would ignore me.


00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.650
Ah- we haven't
met since primary school right?


00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.380
We did meet each other three times
during junior high.


00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:20.890
Speaking of which,


00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.620
we were hit, weren't we?


00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:27.930
Yeah we did.


00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.890
Then why are we still alive?


00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:31.860
Well...


00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.830
As I thought, you two too?


00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.570
I was run over by a car.


00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.360
Eh?


00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:41.100
Sorry. Where is this place?


00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.570
Heaven?


00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.910
A 2LDK.
(A Japanese term which means a building
with 2 living rooms, one dining room and one kitchen)


00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.740
Well, of course that is also
one possible hypothesis.


00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.080
No, no. It's not a hypothesis.
Because I'm surely dead.


00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.480
What the heck is this?


00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.640
Woah woah! Hey.
Stop- stop that...


00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.580
You were like that when you
first came here too.


00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.190
Why is she naked?


00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:19.560
Don't cover her.


00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:20.870
Stop it.


00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.860
Are you alright?


00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.930
"A new morning has come"


00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:56.870
"It's a morning of hope"


00:08:57.150 --> 00:09:00.670
"Open your heart with joy"


00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:04.680
"Look up to the blue sky"


00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:08.410
"Listen to the radio"


00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:12.550
"Take a deep breath"


00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:16.460
"And take in the fragrance
of the wind"


00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:20.460
"And then - one, two, three"


00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.580
"All of your lives have been taken away."


00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:42.930
"How to use your new lives now
is up to me."


00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:47.220
"That's on theory."


00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.290
Huh?


00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.960
"If you want to return home,
go and destroy this guy"


00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.830
The character is...?


00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:09.780
"Onion alien"


00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.000
"Trait"
"Stinky"


00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.170
"Favorite thing"
"Onions"


00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.160
What are these?


00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.420
He's breathing.


00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:45.700
He's warm.


00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.650
That means he's sleeping right?


00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.640
There's a name on it.


00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.270
He's right. Yamada.


00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:19.570
Yes!


00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.080
- How come?
- No idea.


00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:23.910
"Inamori." That's mine.


00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:25.950
Hey, let's move these.


00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.350
Yes.


00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.900
Cosplay?


00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:45.470
What? It means this is mine?


00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.770
Maybe that's true.


00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:51.070
- We are supposed to wear this?
- Dunno...


00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.110
"Kishimoto"


00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.340
Kishimoto-san?


00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.890
We can wear this right?


00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:04.180
Um... I...


00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.290
Am I not dead yet?


00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.730
I don't know about that,
but for now...


00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.460
You're naked.


00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:31.490
The size fits, doesn't it?


00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:34.620
How did it know that I would be coming?


00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:07.450
Excuse me. Is this a toy?


00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.680
As a toy, it is pretty heavy.


00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.990
But look, the muzzle doesn't have any hole.


00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.360
Oh, you're right.


00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:15.720
Hey, don't point it at me.


00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.490
But the muzzle doesn't have any hole.


00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.260
- I said don't point it at me!
- Sorry.


00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.560
Sorry!


00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.830
No, never mind.


00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.730
No please. Tell us.
What is it?


00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:35.970
I just recalled what happened
when I was transported to the hospital.


00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:42.750
For some reason, I have a feeling
that I was drugged there.


00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.680
Drugged?


00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:49.960
Yes. The truth is, I was
involved in a car accident.


00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.460
I was covered in blood and
carried into an emergency room.


00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.330
Then I was injected
with some drug through a syringe.


00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.100
Immediately after that,
everything started to grow hazy...


00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:03.740
Hold on a sec.


00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:06.000
Of course you got an injection.
It's a hospital after all.


00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.920
Yes, sorry.


00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:13.320
I see. I kinda understand what's going on.


00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:17.820
As I thought, we are not yet dead.


00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:22.330
We were transported to the hospital while in apparent death,
and everyone was injected with the same drug.


00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:25.760
What we are seeing right now
are only hallucinations caused by that drug.


00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:27.200
Hallucinations?


00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:30.060
It's like group hypnotism.


00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.570
Perhaps everyone is seeing the
same hallucinations.


00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.040
Hey, that's exactly it!


00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.300
By any chance, we are...


00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:41.140
...being made to participate
in some sort of experiment.


00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.230
What's happening?


00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.620
Well, I don't know.


00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.290
Hallucinations.


00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.300
Kei-chan!


00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.050
What is this?


00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:18.550
Eh?


00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:36.970
"Please go."


00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.560
Huh?


00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:13.640
What? We're outside?


00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:15.610
Eh? What's happening?


00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.110
We got outside right?


00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.940
This means we can go home, right?


00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:28.580
I'm bored of this.


00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.680
Please wait a minute.


00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:35.160
Excuse me. I'm just telling you these things
because I don't want to cheat.


00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:38.130
This is a television program.


00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:41.060
You all are participating
while in your state of apparent death.


00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:42.430
We aren't dead yet!


00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.930
See? We aren't dead!


00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.200
My dad is the producer.


00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.710
American Cable Television
and Yale University...


00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.850
...cooperated together to develop
this new project.


00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.110
Do you know about reality shows?


00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:58.280
It's just like a virtual version
of ATO.


00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.850
You don't know about it?
"American Tryout."


00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:06.650
The main point is, if you get to complete the mission,
you will receive 100 thousand dollars as prize money.


00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:10.090
I wanted that money so I got
to join because of my dad.


00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.960
100 thousand dollars?


00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.760
10 million yen?


00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:21.640
Katou, look at that.


00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.030
Eh?


00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.570
Please look carefully.
That is the target mentioned earlier.


00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.620
What? Really?


00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:34.920
Ah-


00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:36.550
Time limit is 20 minutes.


00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.690
The first person to defeat him
will be awarded with all the money.


00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:47.530
- Seriously?
- Wait for me!


00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:53.900
I was dismissed in a restructuring last month.


00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.170
10 million yen huh?


00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.480
That was a kid just now right?


00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.410
If you're curious, why don't you
go confirm it yourself?


00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:20.030
Oi! Wait! Hey!


00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:29.700
This damned kid!


00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.380
Oi wait! Hey!


00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.740
Spread out. Spread out.


00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.920
What the heck is that kid?


00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.930
I'll give you the onion.
I'll give you the onion.


00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.640
His headgear looks pretty well-done.


00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.110
Oi! You!


00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:09.580
So disgusting.


00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:13.710
Eh?


00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.190
Is that for real?


00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:18.250
Go, go, go! Quickly go!


00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:25.220
No one's been passing here since earlier.


00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:30.530
Huh?
We can't walk through here?


00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.640
This place is Tama.
(a city in Tokyo)


00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:57.160
What was that?


00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.340
I will go take a look.


00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:04.490
What? Oi, wait...!


00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.540
He went off already.


00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:19.450
Ah- where is your house?
I will send you back.


00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:21.610
Um, I'll go too.


00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:22.720
Eh?


00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:25.420
Eh~?


00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:36.160
Surround him! Surround him!


00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:42.970
Huh?


00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:44.710
There he is!


00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:07.690
What did he go?


00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.530
Ah! There, there!


00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:15.230
He's fast.


00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:39.730
Oi! Turn on the light.


00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:53.340
Um...


00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:57.040
Should we attack him with this?


00:22:57.420 --> 00:22:59.780
I'll give you the onion.


00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:02.350
I'll give you the onion.


00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.460
I'll give you the onion.


00:23:22.010 --> 00:23:23.000
Eh?


00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:38.760
That's all?


00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:46.590
It's the real shit!


00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:48.360
This thing's incredible.


00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:52.630
Uwah!


00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:54.940
Ouch-


00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:56.470
Damn!


00:24:00.150 --> 00:24:01.010
Oi!


00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:02.840
Pa..pa...


00:24:23.540 --> 00:24:25.330
Ten million...


00:24:26.840 --> 00:24:28.400
It's so real.


00:24:34.310 --> 00:24:36.080
Stop it already!


00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:11.110
What the heck are you?


00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:13.110
Huh?


00:25:41.220 --> 00:25:42.340
My bad.


00:25:44.790 --> 00:25:47.380
I said it was my bad!


00:26:10.280 --> 00:26:13.210
Just shoot! Shoot! Shoot! Shoot!


00:26:30.330 --> 00:26:33.460
Someone, call the police. The police...


00:27:14.270 --> 00:27:18.110
I'm gonna return to that room soon.


00:27:18.910 --> 00:27:20.940
After the effect of the hypnotism is over...


00:28:00.250 --> 00:28:01.120
Katou.


00:28:04.460 --> 00:28:05.520
Oi Kat-


00:28:45.670 --> 00:28:46.860
This is...


00:29:19.300 --> 00:29:20.730
It doesn't hurt.


00:29:23.770 --> 00:29:24.790
How come?


00:29:25.570 --> 00:29:26.970
Is he for real?


00:29:29.840 --> 00:29:31.310
Shoot.


00:29:34.650 --> 00:29:36.050
It's empty.


00:30:04.480 --> 00:30:06.210
Sorry.


00:30:49.320 --> 00:30:52.950
It's the first time for someone
to use that case.


00:30:53.330 --> 00:30:54.420
That was close, wasn't it?


00:30:55.630 --> 00:30:58.120
But realizing the use of that suit
was remarkable.


00:30:58.400 --> 00:31:02.730
Here. Use this to shoot.
I will give you the points this time round.


00:31:10.840 --> 00:31:12.400
Hurry up.


00:31:12.850 --> 00:31:15.580
Everyone was killed by him.


00:31:48.520 --> 00:31:50.680
Those eyes are looking good.


00:32:12.310 --> 00:32:15.400
What the? I'm seriously disappointed in you.


00:32:16.980 --> 00:32:19.310
If you keep being like that,
you can just die next time.


00:32:48.640 --> 00:32:49.840
Again...?


00:33:28.680 --> 00:33:32.380
It's been a while since the last time
there were other survivors besides me.


00:33:32.990 --> 00:33:36.820
Explain everything.
Is this really for television?


00:33:37.560 --> 00:33:39.080
Why don't you ask GANTZ?


00:33:42.600 --> 00:33:44.030
GANTZ.


00:33:44.500 --> 00:33:48.020
Everyone's been calling it that
ever since before I came here.


00:33:58.450 --> 00:33:59.610
Eh?


00:34:01.210 --> 00:34:02.610
Eh?


00:34:09.960 --> 00:34:13.020
Uncle, you were safe huh?


00:34:13.290 --> 00:34:14.230
What?


00:34:15.130 --> 00:34:19.590
No matter how many injuries one obtains,
if he's still alive, he'll return to his old form.


00:34:37.010 --> 00:34:39.600
"0 point"
"Too much boobs-shaking"


00:34:40.520 --> 00:34:41.820
What is this?


00:34:42.880 --> 00:34:45.090
"O point"
"Scared shitless"


00:34:45.390 --> 00:34:46.380
Eh?


00:34:47.730 --> 00:34:49.890
"0 point"
"Insignificant presence"


00:34:50.730 --> 00:34:51.990
Presence...


00:34:53.490 --> 00:34:55.530
"0 point"
"Looked too much at Kishimoto"


00:34:56.700 --> 00:34:58.100
Huh?


00:35:00.080 --> 00:35:02.410
"5 points"
"TOTAL 79 points"


00:35:04.140 --> 00:35:05.980
Only 5 points huh?


00:35:06.180 --> 00:35:07.110
Hey.


00:35:09.250 --> 00:35:10.840
What is this thing?


00:35:12.620 --> 00:35:15.710
GANTZ gave us scores
based on what we did in the mission.


00:35:16.360 --> 00:35:19.790
In these missions, we will
go destroy aliens who invade the Earth.


00:35:21.590 --> 00:35:23.150
Just who are you?


00:35:29.600 --> 00:35:30.730
I am...


00:35:32.970 --> 00:35:34.340
...an alien too.


00:35:40.910 --> 00:35:43.820
Just kidding.
Don't get so scared.


00:35:44.620 --> 00:35:48.820
Stop fooling around!
What happened to the others?


00:35:49.820 --> 00:35:53.020
They were killed.
You saw that right?


00:35:53.230 --> 00:35:54.420
Look.


00:36:15.950 --> 00:36:21.080
They are all the people who
die from doing GANTZ's missions.


00:36:22.090 --> 00:36:26.080
Wasn't it amazing?
The grand way that yakuza was finished off.


00:36:26.260 --> 00:36:30.860
And that man who said the stuff about hypnotism too.
He was stepped on nicely and got crushed.


00:36:31.030 --> 00:36:33.500
He didn't even realize he was being killed.


00:36:33.670 --> 00:36:36.730
But listen. These days
there is even more incredible stuff...


00:36:36.900 --> 00:36:38.100
You...


00:36:38.400 --> 00:36:41.030
Why didn't you help them?
They were being killed, you know!


00:36:41.810 --> 00:36:46.210
There are people like you around huh?
Such a hypocrite.


00:36:49.650 --> 00:36:51.880
You really don't understand anything!


00:36:59.660 --> 00:37:02.090
You chose to mess with the wrong person.


00:37:06.530 --> 00:37:08.300
Let go of Katou.


00:37:10.840 --> 00:37:12.860
Huh? Are you gonna shoot?


00:37:13.040 --> 00:37:15.100
I will shoot for real this time.


00:37:22.850 --> 00:37:24.980
Explain everything.


00:37:26.220 --> 00:37:28.080
What the heck is this place?


00:37:30.520 --> 00:37:31.720
Say it.


00:37:38.130 --> 00:37:39.430
Too bad.


00:37:40.730 --> 00:37:42.030
I'll see you next time.


00:38:10.830 --> 00:38:12.490
A dream?


00:38:44.430 --> 00:38:47.990
Hey, hey. Isn't this
what we saw yesterday?


00:38:48.230 --> 00:38:51.070
I don't want to be reminded of that.


00:38:55.310 --> 00:38:57.740
Sorry. There's no paper in the toilet.


00:38:57.910 --> 00:38:59.640
And it's dirty too.


00:39:07.750 --> 00:39:09.390
"Calling for eye witnesses"


00:39:09.950 --> 00:39:13.180
"...fell down and was run over by the train..."


00:39:15.700 --> 00:39:17.220
I have always believed that...


00:39:17.400 --> 00:39:21.270
...each one of us definitely has a duty.


00:39:24.670 --> 00:39:28.900
Each and every one has his own
strength and talent.


00:39:29.740 --> 00:39:33.840
And there is a place for him
to display those to the fullest.


00:39:36.420 --> 00:39:39.540
What is it that you want to do
after you enter our company?


00:39:41.690 --> 00:39:42.660
Yes?


00:39:42.820 --> 00:39:44.050
What do you want to do?


00:39:48.930 --> 00:39:52.460
Ah...


00:40:34.510 --> 00:40:37.740
Saying that during an interview,
of course you would fail.


00:40:37.910 --> 00:40:39.040
Give them a better impression
of your characters!


00:40:39.210 --> 00:40:41.270
But I heard Kurono hasn't got any
unofficial offer yet.


00:40:41.450 --> 00:40:43.470
Kurono? He hasn't decided
to take any offer yet huh?


00:40:43.650 --> 00:40:44.950
He has none.


00:40:45.120 --> 00:40:47.810
No matter what one says, Kurono unexpectedly
doesn't have any presence at all.


00:40:48.020 --> 00:40:50.610
He's the type that companies
everywhere don't need the most.


00:40:50.790 --> 00:40:53.160
He's even boasted that he was the hero
of his soccer club a long time ago.


00:40:53.330 --> 00:40:55.260
What? That was
from his primary school days.


00:40:55.430 --> 00:40:57.330
He's the type that might as well
disappear in a company.


00:41:12.750 --> 00:41:15.440
That's all for today's lecture.
We'll end here.


00:41:23.790 --> 00:41:26.820
Um... Please don't be bothered about them.


00:41:27.490 --> 00:41:31.120
It seems that
I'm also just like the air anyway.


00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:34.930
How can you make people
feel your presence, I wonder?


00:41:35.100 --> 00:41:39.040
When I met my primary school friends
at the station the other day...


00:41:40.640 --> 00:41:41.610
Kei-chan?


00:41:41.970 --> 00:41:43.870
We haven't met
since primary school right?


00:41:45.510 --> 00:41:47.240
Katou huh?


00:41:47.750 --> 00:41:49.310
I'm Kojima.


00:41:50.950 --> 00:41:54.780
I'm Kojima Tae.


00:42:01.880 --> 00:42:05.140
"Oota district, Yaguchi, Block 2-34-1"


00:42:15.610 --> 00:42:16.490
"Class 1, year 6"


00:42:16.970 --> 00:42:19.600
"Kurono Kei"
"Katou Masaru"


00:42:27.990 --> 00:42:30.060
"Friends for life
Kaitou Masaru"


00:42:30.460 --> 00:42:32.860
As I thought, Kei-chan is amazing.


00:42:33.160 --> 00:42:36.460
Don't ever forget it Katou.
That fact that I protected you.


00:42:36.660 --> 00:42:39.220
How can I forget?
We are friends for life.


00:42:45.570 --> 00:42:47.770
Akira. You're early.


00:42:47.940 --> 00:42:49.430
It's me.


00:42:50.610 --> 00:42:54.980
Oh Kei huh? You came?
It's been a long time, right?


00:42:55.580 --> 00:42:57.170
But I'm going back now.


00:42:57.420 --> 00:43:00.040
How's it going? Your job hunting?


00:43:00.690 --> 00:43:01.980
Yeah...


00:43:02.820 --> 00:43:05.450
Well, it's just normal.


00:43:06.090 --> 00:43:11.000
Akira already decided to go to to university
a long time ago. You must do your best too.


00:43:21.270 --> 00:43:23.830
His house's no longer here.


00:44:34.910 --> 00:44:36.250
Sorry...


00:44:37.980 --> 00:44:39.580
Ah- oh...


00:44:42.420 --> 00:44:43.550
Ah...


00:44:44.520 --> 00:44:45.890
You can recognize me?


00:44:59.810 --> 00:45:00.700
Wait.


00:45:01.270 --> 00:45:02.260
This is...


00:45:04.080 --> 00:45:06.910
When I woke up, I was wearing it.


00:45:09.780 --> 00:45:13.780
I tried to find Katou's house.


00:45:14.120 --> 00:45:15.250
Katou-san?


00:45:15.990 --> 00:45:18.750
Well, I want to...


00:45:19.660 --> 00:45:23.390
...confirm with him what
happened the day before yesterday.


00:45:24.430 --> 00:45:25.590
But...


00:45:27.430 --> 00:45:30.560
Seems that he's already moved.


00:45:31.370 --> 00:45:34.740
His address was from 10 years ago anyway.


00:45:36.910 --> 00:45:38.810
Is that right?


00:45:43.050 --> 00:45:44.850
Shall we go to the police?


00:45:46.750 --> 00:45:49.020
I don't think they will believe us.


00:45:50.360 --> 00:45:52.090
You're right.


00:45:56.630 --> 00:46:00.530
Shall I send you off until the station?
Okay?


00:46:04.570 --> 00:46:08.170
Um... I have a favor to ask of you.


00:46:08.340 --> 00:46:09.140
What is it?


00:46:09.310 --> 00:46:10.740
Will you let me stay over tonight?


00:46:10.910 --> 00:46:11.880
Yes.


00:46:13.450 --> 00:46:14.440
Yes?


00:46:26.160 --> 00:46:28.060
Is it okay for me to sleep on the bed?


00:46:28.230 --> 00:46:29.390
Sure, go ahead.


00:46:29.630 --> 00:46:30.990
Thank you.


00:46:42.240 --> 00:46:46.200
But if I sleep on the floor,
my body will surely ache all over.


00:46:46.450 --> 00:46:47.880
Shall I sleep on the floor then?


00:46:48.250 --> 00:46:50.610
Ah it's fine. Just sleep on the bed.


00:46:52.620 --> 00:46:55.520
But Kishimoto-san.
Is it really fine this way?


00:46:55.690 --> 00:46:57.210
You're not going home.


00:46:59.190 --> 00:47:01.220
My boyfriend's belongings are there.


00:47:05.760 --> 00:47:08.760
You were living together?


00:47:10.700 --> 00:47:14.900
We broke up the other day.
He went to another woman's house.


00:47:16.210 --> 00:47:17.330
Oh.


00:47:19.250 --> 00:47:20.370
Ah-


00:47:22.050 --> 00:47:23.280
I see.


00:47:32.590 --> 00:47:36.530
Then, I just did it unconsciously
while in the bathroom...


00:47:37.130 --> 00:47:38.430
...cutting my wrist.


00:47:44.370 --> 00:47:47.000
I wasn't doing it for real though.


00:47:50.410 --> 00:47:53.540
You committed suicided?


00:47:56.050 --> 00:48:01.680
Then, when I recovered,
I was at home.


00:48:04.520 --> 00:48:08.620
All that while I couldn't bear
to look at the bathroom.


00:48:10.560 --> 00:48:15.060
I thought there might be full of blood
from my dead body, and felt scared.


00:48:49.940 --> 00:48:50.920
What is that?


00:48:52.370 --> 00:48:54.600
Katou-san's coat that I borrowed from him.


00:48:57.210 --> 00:48:59.370
I want to meet him.


00:49:00.710 --> 00:49:03.810
To return him this and thank him.


00:49:09.660 --> 00:49:11.280
It's his notebook.


00:49:12.060 --> 00:49:14.180
Maybe his current address is written here.


00:49:19.430 --> 00:49:20.590
Hm?


00:49:27.040 --> 00:49:28.730
Probation?


00:49:30.640 --> 00:49:33.390
"Under probation. Katou Masaru"


00:49:35.620 --> 00:49:37.550
He was in a juvenile institution?


00:49:40.630 --> 00:49:41.440
Let's stop this.


00:49:41.620 --> 00:49:43.680
Eh? But his address is written there.


00:49:43.860 --> 00:49:44.580
What?


00:49:47.930 --> 00:49:50.050
So he's like that?


00:49:50.600 --> 00:49:56.060
Somehow I heard that he didn't
go to high school or something.


00:49:57.400 --> 00:50:00.030
Who cares about such a thing?


00:50:00.640 --> 00:50:05.410
Well long ago,
many things happened to his family.


00:50:06.680 --> 00:50:08.870
His drunken father used to turn violent.


00:50:09.150 --> 00:50:10.580
Well he's definitely like that too...


00:50:10.750 --> 00:50:12.980
Katou-san is not that kind of person.


00:50:13.190 --> 00:50:14.020
How-


00:50:14.290 --> 00:50:15.880
How would you know?


00:50:16.690 --> 00:50:19.210
There's no one as kind as he is.


00:50:24.560 --> 00:50:28.500
If I had been able to meet him
a little sooner...


00:50:35.210 --> 00:50:37.330
...you wouldn't have died?


00:50:48.220 --> 00:50:50.250
Just saying.


00:50:53.090 --> 00:50:53.960
Sorry.


00:50:54.130 --> 00:50:56.920
Ah, I'll turn off the light.


00:52:02.730 --> 00:52:03.390
Nii-chan.


00:52:48.970 --> 00:52:50.670
Nii-chan.


00:52:53.410 --> 00:52:55.280
You're not sleeping yet?


00:52:56.150 --> 00:52:57.740
Just after a while more.


00:52:57.920 --> 00:53:01.480
You were like this yesterday's night too right?
Did you have a bad dream?


00:53:05.090 --> 00:53:07.180
Come on. Go to sleep Ayumu.


00:53:07.630 --> 00:53:09.720
Don't sleep late. Or else you
won't have breakfast tomorrow.


00:53:42.660 --> 00:53:43.890
Again?


00:54:09.990 --> 00:54:13.750
"A new morning has come"


00:54:14.030 --> 00:54:17.660
"It's a morning of hope"


00:54:17.930 --> 00:54:21.560
"Open your heart with joy"


00:54:21.830 --> 00:54:25.560
"Look up to the blue sky"


00:54:25.740 --> 00:54:28.210
"Listen to the radio"


00:54:28.370 --> 00:54:29.900
These are all the people for tonight huh?


00:54:30.080 --> 00:54:33.340
"Take a deep breath"


00:54:33.610 --> 00:54:37.210
"And take in the fragrance
of the wind"


00:54:37.480 --> 00:54:41.210
"And then - one, two, three"


00:54:47.330 --> 00:54:51.190
"All of your lives have been taken away."


00:54:51.190 --> 00:54:55.600
"How to use your new lives now is up to me."
"That's on theory."


00:54:59.540 --> 00:55:04.230
"If you want to return home,
go and destroy this guy"


00:55:12.820 --> 00:55:13.860
"Tanaka's alien"


00:55:13.860 --> 00:55:15.160
"Trait"
"Energetic"


00:55:15.160 --> 00:55:18.670
"Favorite thing"
"Radio cassette"


00:55:27.470 --> 00:55:29.160
You already got it right?


00:55:31.200 --> 00:55:35.160
GANTZ must have done a scan about
all of us, so it knows everything.


00:55:35.510 --> 00:55:37.980
That's why you won't be able
to run away anymore.


00:55:38.780 --> 00:55:41.410
No matter where you are,
you will be summoned here all the same.


00:55:42.780 --> 00:55:44.340
Every time, you say?


00:55:45.250 --> 00:55:48.050
That sort of thing is gonna
happen many times again?


00:55:48.920 --> 00:55:50.010
That's right.


00:55:50.960 --> 00:55:54.620
Long before I came here,
people have been gathered up.


00:55:54.790 --> 00:55:58.230
They fought aliens, and if
they are killed, others will fill in their places.


00:56:00.730 --> 00:56:02.630
A lot of people have died.


00:56:03.640 --> 00:56:06.160
Among those,
I'm the one who's survived.


00:56:09.510 --> 00:56:12.140
Why didn't you tell us that?


00:56:13.250 --> 00:56:15.810
If you had explained that right
from the start,


00:56:16.050 --> 00:56:18.710
other people might
have been saved right?


00:56:19.050 --> 00:56:19.980
Huh?


00:56:20.520 --> 00:56:24.180
You really don't get a thing,
right you hypocrite?


00:56:25.360 --> 00:56:27.660
They were his decoys.


00:56:28.160 --> 00:56:29.890
Correct.


00:56:30.200 --> 00:56:32.530
As I thought, you are similar to me.


00:56:32.730 --> 00:56:33.430
Huh?


00:56:33.600 --> 00:56:37.830
Aliens are unprepared when
they are about to kill humans.


00:56:40.640 --> 00:56:41.940
Isn't that funny?


00:56:42.970 --> 00:56:44.810
Explain everything properly.


00:56:44.980 --> 00:56:46.970
What should those who survive do?


00:56:47.150 --> 00:56:48.810
Explain that to everyone!


00:56:49.450 --> 00:56:54.940
Stop depending on others.
Why don't you think for yourself a little? Huh?


00:56:57.320 --> 00:56:58.410
Ah-


00:57:02.490 --> 00:57:03.620
This.


00:57:05.160 --> 00:57:08.660
That's right. We just need to wear this.


00:57:08.830 --> 00:57:10.360
Then I'm going first.


00:57:11.600 --> 00:57:13.370
Good luck.


00:57:14.570 --> 00:57:16.270
Obaa-chan! Obaa-chan!


00:57:16.440 --> 00:57:18.880
Then how many times will I have to do this?


00:57:19.040 --> 00:57:19.700
How many times?


00:57:19.880 --> 00:57:21.040
Well, we don't know about that.


00:57:21.210 --> 00:57:22.740
Anyway let's just put our suits on.


00:57:23.010 --> 00:57:24.310
Get those trunks.


00:57:26.120 --> 00:57:27.140
Here you go.


00:57:27.320 --> 00:57:28.380
This too right?


00:57:28.550 --> 00:57:30.020
Thank you.


00:57:30.020 --> 00:57:31.020
"Please go."


00:57:41.400 --> 00:57:46.500
Obaa-chan!
Where are you, Obaa-chan?


00:57:47.410 --> 00:57:50.640
Obaa-chan! Obaa-chan!


00:57:50.940 --> 00:57:54.280
Ryo-chan? Ryo-chan!


00:57:55.580 --> 00:57:57.410
Ryo-chan!


00:57:57.580 --> 00:58:02.350
Obaa-chan!
Where are you, Obaa-chan?


00:58:03.020 --> 00:58:04.110
Ryo-chan?


00:58:04.290 --> 00:58:06.520
Obaa-chan!


00:58:06.690 --> 00:58:08.160
Ryo-chan!


00:58:09.490 --> 00:58:11.190
Ryo-chan!


00:58:13.630 --> 00:58:15.830
Obaa-chan!


00:58:24.880 --> 00:58:26.040
Ryo-chan!


00:58:26.680 --> 00:58:28.700
Obaa-chan!


00:58:31.050 --> 00:58:35.010
Ryo-chan, it's alright now.
I'm here.


00:58:38.060 --> 00:58:40.820
It's fine. It's fine.


00:58:41.630 --> 00:58:43.860
I'm here. Okay?


00:59:15.190 --> 00:59:20.630
"From me to you"


00:59:20.870 --> 00:59:26.000
"I'll reach you through this song"


00:59:26.300 --> 00:59:30.830
"In this whole wide world,
there's only one person"


00:59:31.010 --> 00:59:32.410
What is this?


00:59:32.580 --> 00:59:37.070
"To the one I love that is you"


00:59:37.320 --> 00:59:41.720
"To you who have grown old"


00:59:41.950 --> 00:59:42.940
Ah-


00:59:44.760 --> 00:59:46.280
Kurono-kun!


01:00:59.970 --> 01:01:01.930
Things are bad for him...


01:01:17.820 --> 01:01:19.510
My suit's dead!


01:01:20.750 --> 01:01:21.880
Help me!


01:01:22.290 --> 01:01:23.220
Alright!


01:01:26.660 --> 01:01:28.260
Help me! Oi!


01:01:28.990 --> 01:01:29.930
Katou?


01:01:30.430 --> 01:01:31.420
Katou-san?


01:02:10.370 --> 01:02:11.430
He's incredible.


01:02:34.860 --> 01:02:36.420
Oi! Can you hear me?


01:02:40.600 --> 01:02:42.000
Hang in there.


01:02:44.170 --> 01:02:47.160
Get... 100 points.


01:02:47.770 --> 01:02:51.870
100 points?
What will happen if I get 100 points?


01:02:54.850 --> 01:02:57.110
With 100 points...


01:02:58.080 --> 01:03:00.710
...return me... to life.


01:03:03.590 --> 01:03:04.450
What?


01:04:06.150 --> 01:04:06.910
Katou!


01:04:11.320 --> 01:04:12.220
Eh-!


01:04:29.070 --> 01:04:30.540
Katou, I'm gonna shoot!
Get out of the way!


01:04:30.710 --> 01:04:31.800
I can't!


01:04:57.300 --> 01:04:58.500
Don't come!


01:05:08.180 --> 01:05:10.510
Don't come! Don't come!


01:05:30.370 --> 01:05:31.360
Eh?


01:05:38.440 --> 01:05:39.500
Me?


01:05:46.220 --> 01:05:48.120
Whoa whoa whoa!


01:05:50.120 --> 01:05:51.280
Wait! Wait!


01:06:15.280 --> 01:06:17.710
That hurt!


01:06:59.960 --> 01:07:01.120
Kei-chan.


01:07:26.820 --> 01:07:29.380
Sorry. I hit you first.


01:07:46.800 --> 01:07:48.170
Kei-chan...


01:07:51.740 --> 01:07:53.040
Kei-chan!


01:09:11.720 --> 01:09:13.020
Kei-chan?


01:09:14.130 --> 01:09:16.120
What happened to Kei-chan?


01:09:16.560 --> 01:09:20.360
Oi! What happened to Kei-chan?


01:09:21.170 --> 01:09:23.430
Oi! What happened to Kei-chan?


01:09:24.240 --> 01:09:26.030
What happened to him?


01:09:49.930 --> 01:09:51.160
Eh?


01:09:52.100 --> 01:09:53.720
That's great.


01:10:05.140 --> 01:10:06.870
I'm still alive?


01:10:22.360 --> 01:10:24.800
"Well then, let's see the points"


01:10:27.760 --> 01:10:30.170
"O point"
"Looked at Katou too much"


01:10:33.400 --> 01:10:34.920
"O point"
"Was looked at too much by Kishimoto"


01:10:35.740 --> 01:10:39.010
What are these points for?


01:10:40.100 --> 01:10:41.670
"0 point"
"Were you there?"


01:10:42.010 --> 01:10:42.810
Eh?


01:10:44.020 --> 01:10:45.540
"0 point"
"You were there huh?"


01:10:46.380 --> 01:10:47.320
Eh?


01:10:48.790 --> 01:10:50.420
"7 points"
"TOTAL 7 points"


01:10:51.490 --> 01:10:52.350
7...


01:10:53.120 --> 01:10:54.750
I did it.


01:10:55.410 --> 01:10:57.870
"93 points left till it's over"


01:11:25.720 --> 01:11:28.350
Get... 10 points.


01:11:42.170 --> 01:11:43.370
GANTZ.


01:11:46.280 --> 01:11:48.910
What will happen if I get 100 points?


01:11:51.240 --> 01:11:55.320
"You can choose from 100 points menu"


01:12:00.400 --> 01:12:02.250
"100 points menu"


01:12:02.250 --> 01:12:09.490
"1. Erase all your memory and get released"
"2. Return the person you love to life "


01:12:09.930 --> 01:12:11.530
Get released?


01:12:11.700 --> 01:12:14.670
We can revive even dead people?


01:12:42.600 --> 01:12:44.030
Huh?


01:12:54.350 --> 01:12:56.250
Is this for real?


01:13:39.120 --> 01:13:40.220
Alright.


01:15:18.290 --> 01:15:19.310
Yes?


01:15:19.490 --> 01:15:21.320
Ah! You picked up!


01:15:23.030 --> 01:15:25.590
It's me, Kojima.
I was with you at the lecture.


01:15:25.760 --> 01:15:30.760
This is the first time I'm calling you.
Where are you now?


01:15:32.500 --> 01:15:33.370
Eh...


01:15:33.770 --> 01:15:35.760
Where, you ask...


01:15:37.140 --> 01:15:40.630
Kurono-kun, have you ever
read manga?


01:15:41.050 --> 01:15:42.570
Of course I have.


01:15:42.910 --> 01:15:44.780
Do you like it?


01:15:46.750 --> 01:15:49.050
Just normally... I guess.


01:15:49.690 --> 01:15:53.280
Um... please don't laugh at me.


01:15:53.720 --> 01:15:58.890
Um... I draw manga.


01:16:01.800 --> 01:16:02.960
What kind?


01:16:15.750 --> 01:16:17.910
How is it?


01:16:21.120 --> 01:16:22.280
Amazing.


01:16:25.060 --> 01:16:28.490
Though it's a story with
a hero and such, I drew it as a shoujo manga.


01:16:28.660 --> 01:16:30.650
Don't you think it's pretty awful?


01:16:31.230 --> 01:16:33.700
It's about a normal guy like Kurono-kun...


01:16:33.860 --> 01:16:36.130
...who is chosen to be the hero of justice...


01:16:36.600 --> 01:16:38.530
He's like my old self.


01:16:39.640 --> 01:16:40.760
Eh?


01:16:43.840 --> 01:16:47.140
No. I just remembered something.


01:16:49.050 --> 01:16:50.710
When I was a kid,


01:16:51.280 --> 01:16:53.840
I used to protect another weak kid
who was bullied then.


01:16:54.790 --> 01:16:56.620
Is that right?


01:16:56.820 --> 01:16:57.880
Yeah.


01:16:59.090 --> 01:17:03.190
I happened to meet that
weak guy again the other day.


01:17:06.330 --> 01:17:10.560
But I guess he doesn't remember
that I used to protect him.


01:17:14.670 --> 01:17:16.110
As expected,


01:17:17.880 --> 01:17:20.900
heroes have to destroy the bad guys.


01:17:26.980 --> 01:17:29.480
The weak one can just run away...


01:17:29.650 --> 01:17:31.810
...because everyone's protecting him.


01:17:52.210 --> 01:17:53.110
Ah-


01:17:56.110 --> 01:17:57.840
Sorry. This...


01:18:03.690 --> 01:18:05.660
Did you meet my younger brother?


01:18:08.590 --> 01:18:11.460
But I didn't talk to him.


01:18:13.230 --> 01:18:17.060
Um, I just don't know how to
explain all this.


01:18:24.580 --> 01:18:26.130
Katou-san.


01:18:27.850 --> 01:18:30.750
What does it mean to us
by waking up in that place?


01:18:32.750 --> 01:18:35.690
Are we dead?


01:18:37.020 --> 01:18:38.650
Or alive?


01:18:43.030 --> 01:18:47.230
When I arrived at that room,


01:18:48.230 --> 01:18:50.890
I thought I could finally die.


01:18:52.870 --> 01:18:54.170
For a long time,


01:18:55.610 --> 01:18:58.010
I've been thinking that I should just die.


01:19:02.880 --> 01:19:05.850
But now, I want to live longer.


01:19:09.050 --> 01:19:11.180
It's because I met you, Katou-san.


01:19:16.060 --> 01:19:19.360
I was saved by you.


01:19:21.530 --> 01:19:22.260
That's why...


01:19:22.430 --> 01:19:23.630
I...


01:19:24.540 --> 01:19:26.660
...used to be in a juvenile institution.


01:19:33.880 --> 01:19:35.870
I killed my dad.


01:19:41.720 --> 01:19:43.080
My dad...


01:19:44.190 --> 01:19:46.820
...used to get drunk every day,
and he would beat my brother.


01:19:48.030 --> 01:19:49.750
I wanted to save him.


01:19:50.660 --> 01:19:52.560
But I couldn't save anyone.


01:19:54.000 --> 01:19:56.630
I couldn't even stay by Ayumu's side.


01:20:01.340 --> 01:20:02.900
That's why...


01:20:03.070 --> 01:20:05.600
...I don't want to leave Ayumu alone anymore.


01:20:11.480 --> 01:20:14.110
I'm so sorry, for saying weird things.


01:20:15.250 --> 01:20:17.080
I'll send you back.


01:20:41.380 --> 01:20:44.310
"In Shinagawa City, Tokyo,
at a multi-story car park  in Yashio,"


01:20:44.480 --> 01:20:46.680
"a large fire broke out in the early dawn
on the fifth day of this month."


01:20:46.850 --> 01:20:48.150
"It was caused by the gasoline
which leaked out from a car..."


01:20:48.320 --> 01:20:50.680
"...and for some reason,
was seen catching fire."


01:20:50.850 --> 01:20:54.290
"However, the detailed situation and
causes are yet to be specified."


01:20:54.790 --> 01:20:57.390
"Besides, in places
such as Tama City and Minato Ward,"


01:20:57.560 --> 01:21:00.960
"several years ago, some properties
were damaged without any clear causes."


01:21:01.130 --> 01:21:04.030
"The police have gathered
this time's series of fires to be..."


01:21:12.780 --> 01:21:15.940
Have you been feeling worn out recently?
Take a break from your work today.


01:21:16.650 --> 01:21:18.640
If it's tough on you,
I will work part-time too.


01:21:18.820 --> 01:21:22.550
What are you talking about?
You have to study.


01:21:23.290 --> 01:21:25.220
As I thought, something unpleasant
happened right?


01:21:25.460 --> 01:21:27.220
There's none, really.


01:21:36.500 --> 01:21:40.490
I've been having lots of
nightmares lately.


01:21:42.340 --> 01:21:44.310
A lot of people die...


01:21:45.280 --> 01:21:46.770
...and get killed...


01:21:48.150 --> 01:21:50.810
...but I'm not able to do anything.


01:21:51.950 --> 01:21:55.180
I'm not able to save anyone.


01:22:01.760 --> 01:22:03.450
Then isn't it good that it's just a dream?


01:22:05.960 --> 01:22:07.190
I suppose.


01:22:09.830 --> 01:22:13.170
Speaking of which, recently I've been having
lots of these dreams...


01:22:13.340 --> 01:22:15.830
...in which Nii-chan goes missing
somewhere.


01:22:17.070 --> 01:22:18.300
But I'm not scared.


01:22:18.480 --> 01:22:20.670
The one who's gonna be in trouble
if separated from me is you.


01:22:20.840 --> 01:22:22.610
Can you even cook?


01:22:26.280 --> 01:22:28.310
- Ayumu.
- Hm?


01:22:28.850 --> 01:22:32.190
I'm not going anywhere,
nor am I gonna disappear.


01:22:32.360 --> 01:22:35.190
I know that. Hand them to me.


01:22:53.610 --> 01:22:55.370
I have always believed that...


01:22:55.910 --> 01:22:59.370
...each one of us definitely has a duty.


01:23:00.620 --> 01:23:03.640
Each and every one has his own
strength and talent.


01:23:03.890 --> 01:23:07.850
And there is a place for him
to display those to the fullest.


01:23:11.190 --> 01:23:12.530
There it came.


01:23:13.030 --> 01:23:14.860
It came, it came, it came!


01:23:19.400 --> 01:23:20.730
Ayumu.


01:23:22.670 --> 01:23:25.070
I will definitely be going back.


01:23:53.640 --> 01:23:55.830
Is it gonna start again?


01:23:56.010 --> 01:23:57.200
Yes.


01:24:09.920 --> 01:24:12.290
Are you clear, everyone?


01:24:13.720 --> 01:24:16.630
There are people who will go to paradise...


01:24:17.490 --> 01:24:19.930
...and there are those
who will fall into the Avici Hell...


01:24:20.500 --> 01:24:24.990
Dead people are gathered here,
and will be divided into these two groups.


01:24:25.600 --> 01:24:28.500
That's right! Buddha will look at us...


01:24:26.450 --> 01:24:33.240
"Short-tempered alien"
"Trait: big"
"Favorite thing: quiet places"


01:24:28.670 --> 01:24:33.300
...and, right here right now,
bestow you with a judgment.


01:24:35.220 --> 01:24:37.510
Everyone, you haven't died yet.


01:24:37.910 --> 01:24:41.010
Please fight together so that we can be
alive to come back.


01:24:41.650 --> 01:24:43.950
Right now I'll try to
explain to you as much as I can.


01:24:44.450 --> 01:24:47.420
Firstly, please wear the suit
contained in this case.


01:24:47.660 --> 01:24:50.020
After this, we'll be experiencing
many things.


01:24:50.190 --> 01:24:52.960
Even if you don't want to fight,
you have to.


01:24:53.130 --> 01:24:54.530
Enough!


01:24:56.000 --> 01:24:58.630
You mustn't be swayed, everyone.


01:24:59.440 --> 01:25:03.200
Just as God has said,
this person is blinded by earthly desires...


01:25:03.540 --> 01:25:07.340
Please believe in me.
Everyone will survive together.


01:25:07.640 --> 01:25:10.810
Please wear your suit.
Hurry up!


01:25:11.310 --> 01:25:12.680
Katou!


01:25:13.720 --> 01:25:17.150
Katou! It's just futile for you to explain those
things to people who are here for the first time.


01:25:17.320 --> 01:25:19.450
Kei-chan, don't you
want to save these people?


01:25:19.620 --> 01:25:20.610
Told you I'll do it alone.


01:25:20.790 --> 01:25:22.990
If you do that, you're gonna die.
Just like that high school boy.


01:25:23.160 --> 01:25:25.250
I'm different from that guy.


01:25:27.830 --> 01:25:31.460
It's gonna be alright.
I will protect you as well.


01:25:31.640 --> 01:25:35.260
No need to worry about me.
I don't want anybody to die anymore.


01:25:36.770 --> 01:25:38.240
Hey Katou.


01:25:40.340 --> 01:25:42.610
Did you really mean that?


01:25:43.180 --> 01:25:47.170
You just want to return to our old world
on your own, don't you? Huh?


01:25:47.580 --> 01:25:48.780
No...


01:25:50.990 --> 01:25:52.720
I hit the bull's eye huh?


01:25:54.390 --> 01:25:56.360
You're really just a hypocrite.


01:25:56.560 --> 01:25:57.890
That's not my intention!


01:25:58.360 --> 01:26:01.230
You went to a juvenile institution,
so don't act cool!


01:26:07.100 --> 01:26:08.540
Take your hand off me.


01:26:11.210 --> 01:26:13.070
Let go!


01:26:19.220 --> 01:26:20.310
Katou-san.


01:26:20.480 --> 01:26:22.180
The two of you, now is not the time...


01:26:28.060 --> 01:26:29.220
No way!


01:26:34.460 --> 01:26:35.260
Ah!


01:26:35.630 --> 01:26:39.570
Sorry, what about Hitomi?
I was with her until now...


01:26:42.970 --> 01:26:44.910
Will you wear your suit, please?


01:26:45.380 --> 01:26:48.440
Please believe in that guy earlier.


01:27:28.540 --> 01:27:29.510
Incredible.


01:27:29.580 --> 01:27:31.340
Isn't this place Ueno?


01:27:31.520 --> 01:27:33.210
It looks super real.


01:28:31.340 --> 01:28:32.830
That is...?


01:28:54.530 --> 01:28:58.140
The target has a sphere there.


01:29:05.380 --> 01:29:07.240
Everyone, please listen.


01:29:07.650 --> 01:29:11.080
From now on, unbelievable things will happen.


01:29:11.150 --> 01:29:13.280
Terrifying things will happen.


01:29:13.290 --> 01:29:16.950
But if everyone cooperates,
without anyone dying, we can...


01:29:22.100 --> 01:29:22.930
Hm.


01:29:23.600 --> 01:29:24.760
What the heck is that?


01:29:46.190 --> 01:29:47.620
Flee!


01:29:48.050 --> 01:29:49.450
Flee!


01:29:50.090 --> 01:29:51.520
Hurry!


01:32:22.610 --> 01:32:25.440
Everyone, surround it.
We'll surround it and shoot.


01:32:29.080 --> 01:32:30.550
Kei-chan! Move aside!


01:32:30.850 --> 01:32:32.780
I said I would do it.


01:32:40.590 --> 01:32:41.990
Damn it!


01:32:47.970 --> 01:32:49.160
Kei-chan, fall back!


01:33:23.840 --> 01:33:25.240
You get everyone out of here.


01:33:25.400 --> 01:33:26.170
You can't do it alone.


01:33:26.340 --> 01:33:27.500
I'll take care of that guy.


01:33:27.670 --> 01:33:28.540
It's impossible!


01:33:50.600 --> 01:33:51.430
I got it.


01:33:52.300 --> 01:33:53.320
You're getting in the way!


01:34:49.590 --> 01:34:51.220
With this,
you won't have any complain right?


01:34:52.990 --> 01:34:54.890
That was no good at all.


01:34:55.930 --> 01:34:57.090
The other people have died.


01:34:57.260 --> 01:35:00.060
That's because you didn't
manage to have everyone escape right?


01:35:03.200 --> 01:35:04.330
Well, doesn't matter.


01:35:04.640 --> 01:35:07.070
Next time, you can just
help everyone run away.


01:35:07.240 --> 01:35:09.400
I will destroy the enemies
by myself.


01:35:12.040 --> 01:35:13.070
Huh?


01:35:14.880 --> 01:35:17.780
What the? We can't go back
to the room yet?


01:35:49.620 --> 01:35:51.140
It hurts...


01:35:57.160 --> 01:35:58.150
Oi!


01:36:01.660 --> 01:36:03.090
Did she die?


01:36:05.100 --> 01:36:06.620
It's still there.


01:38:01.350 --> 01:38:03.250
Kurono-san. Your back.


01:38:31.040 --> 01:38:32.510
Thousand-armed Goddess of Mercy?


01:39:01.870 --> 01:39:03.740
Damn it!


01:39:06.980 --> 01:39:08.170
I will go.


01:39:09.350 --> 01:39:11.750
It's impossible for you!


01:39:11.920 --> 01:39:12.880
You can't do it with this body.


01:39:13.050 --> 01:39:14.610
I'm fine.


01:39:16.090 --> 01:39:20.220
You haven't changed at all.
That's why you were so cool.


01:39:24.230 --> 01:39:28.100
I've always wanted to become like you.


01:39:29.170 --> 01:39:30.290
But...


01:39:33.540 --> 01:39:35.560
It's just as you said.


01:39:36.280 --> 01:39:40.300
Maybe I just want to go back by myself.


01:39:43.280 --> 01:39:45.410
Perhaps I'm really just a hypocrite.


01:39:48.150 --> 01:39:50.250
Please take care of Kei-chan.


01:39:54.230 --> 01:39:55.520
Katou!


01:40:56.160 --> 01:40:59.990
So you were the ones who
attacked earlier?


01:41:03.630 --> 01:41:07.390
You killed my comrade.


01:41:16.580 --> 01:41:18.010
This is my revenge.


01:41:31.120 --> 01:41:33.090
Run away, Katou-san!


01:41:50.040 --> 01:41:50.970
Eh?


01:43:33.950 --> 01:43:35.570
Katou-san...


01:43:39.220 --> 01:43:41.310
...you have to...


01:43:42.920 --> 01:43:44.390
...return to Ayumu-kun's side, right?


01:45:03.770 --> 01:45:04.860
Katou...


01:45:48.150 --> 01:45:49.440
Katou.


01:45:54.120 --> 01:45:55.810
I will take revenge.


01:45:56.360 --> 01:46:00.310
You people
and you people's countrymen...


01:46:00.690 --> 01:46:02.820
I will kill everyone.


01:49:28.530 --> 01:49:30.730
Kei-chan!


01:49:31.840 --> 01:49:33.100
Katou!


01:49:58.700 --> 01:49:59.990
I can...


01:50:01.800 --> 01:50:03.600
I can do it.


01:50:14.410 --> 01:50:15.170
Ah!


01:50:17.420 --> 01:50:18.400
Kei-chan.


01:51:07.000 --> 01:51:08.560
Amazing.


01:51:26.520 --> 01:51:27.580
Katou.


01:51:27.950 --> 01:51:29.180
Katou.


01:51:30.790 --> 01:51:32.120
Katou!


01:51:34.460 --> 01:51:37.590
Katou. It's all over.


01:51:38.200 --> 01:51:41.760
As expected, you're amazing, Kei-chan.


01:51:46.340 --> 01:51:47.360
Katou.


01:51:50.010 --> 01:51:55.470
Hang in there.
We're gonna return to that room soon.


01:51:57.480 --> 01:51:59.350
Thanks to Kei-chan,


01:52:01.520 --> 01:52:03.210
I can go back...


01:52:04.990 --> 01:52:06.220
...to Ayumu's side.


01:52:07.730 --> 01:52:08.950
Katou.


01:52:11.200 --> 01:52:14.960
Oi! Oi GANTZ! Hurry up!


01:52:23.540 --> 01:52:27.770
Katou. You mustn't die.


01:52:27.980 --> 01:52:30.070
I'll be waiting.
I'll go first and wait for...


01:53:06.100 --> 01:53:08.390
"Well then, let's see the points"


01:53:10.520 --> 01:53:13.620
Wa- wait a minute!


01:53:14.390 --> 01:53:16.420
Katou isn't here yet.


01:53:19.090 --> 01:53:22.390
"13 points"
"TOTAL 20 points"
"80 points left until it's over"


01:53:26.670 --> 01:53:28.300
GANTZ.


01:53:30.340 --> 01:53:32.310
Give back...


01:54:07.510 --> 01:54:09.170
...those who have died.


01:54:11.850 --> 01:54:14.440
Give Katou back!


01:54:16.410 --> 01:54:18.730
"100 points menu"


01:54:18.730 --> 01:54:23.730
"1. Erase all your memory and get released"
"2. Return the person you love to life "


01:54:31.170 --> 01:54:34.500
You mean I have to fight
in order to return people to life?


01:54:39.740 --> 01:54:43.080
I have to fight until I get 100 points?


01:54:51.890 --> 01:54:54.690
That's just impossible.


01:55:58.990 --> 01:56:00.250
Um...


01:56:02.660 --> 01:56:05.790
I've drawn the next part for the manga.


01:56:19.180 --> 01:56:23.140
Sorry. Somehow today...


01:56:24.520 --> 01:56:28.180
...I'm just not in the mood to read manga.


01:56:29.450 --> 01:56:30.610
Ah...


01:56:32.420 --> 01:56:35.260
Um, sorry...


01:56:36.430 --> 01:56:38.730
Did something happen?


01:56:42.000 --> 01:56:45.800
The other day, when you read my manga...


01:56:45.970 --> 01:56:47.440
Actually...


01:56:48.040 --> 01:56:49.440
Kurono-kun.


01:56:51.140 --> 01:56:53.200
Though you liked it,


01:56:55.850 --> 01:57:00.880
...um, somehow... you looked strange.


01:57:02.450 --> 01:57:06.220
Um, I was scared.


01:57:07.860 --> 01:57:12.460
I have always been watching Kurono-kun,
so I can tell.


01:57:13.700 --> 01:57:16.630
Ah- sorry for watching you
like that.


01:57:17.500 --> 01:57:19.300
Someone like me...


01:57:20.000 --> 01:57:22.440
...is just creepy right?


01:57:26.710 --> 01:57:29.040
Ah! It dropped.


01:57:33.990 --> 01:57:36.180
Get me my cap.


01:57:36.350 --> 01:57:39.050
I can't. The train's coming already. Okay?


01:57:39.220 --> 01:57:41.160
But you see, the train's coming soon.


01:57:41.330 --> 01:57:43.230
- Get me my cap.
- What should I do?


01:57:43.390 --> 01:57:45.860
Get me my cap.


01:57:46.030 --> 01:57:48.430
But the train's coming soon. Okay?


01:57:49.100 --> 01:57:50.970
Ehh? What should I do...


01:57:57.610 --> 01:57:58.700
Thank you.


01:57:58.910 --> 01:57:59.880
Here.


01:58:00.550 --> 01:58:03.110
Thank you very much.
Come on, thank him.


01:58:03.280 --> 01:58:04.710
Thank you.


01:58:04.880 --> 01:58:06.040
Thank you.


01:58:06.850 --> 01:58:12.380
"The train on line number 2 will arrive
in a moment."


01:58:12.620 --> 01:58:13.920
Since it is dangerous,


01:58:14.090 --> 01:58:17.360
"Please stand behind the yellow line."


01:58:26.140 --> 01:58:27.760
Kurono-kun?


01:58:32.380 --> 01:58:34.000
What are you doing?


01:58:34.480 --> 01:58:35.910
Quickly come up!


01:58:40.450 --> 01:58:41.680
Kurono-kun!


01:58:45.490 --> 01:58:46.860
Kurono-kun!


01:58:50.030 --> 01:58:51.150
You mustn't die!


01:59:07.680 --> 01:59:09.110
Sorry.


01:59:14.590 --> 01:59:16.650
I like you!


01:59:17.020 --> 01:59:20.320
I like you, Kurono-kun!


01:59:23.160 --> 01:59:24.560
That's why...


01:59:26.260 --> 01:59:28.890
That's why, please don't die.


02:00:20.320 --> 02:00:21.510
Nii-chan?


02:00:26.790 --> 02:00:28.120
You're Ayumu-kun?


02:00:28.490 --> 02:00:29.360
Yes.


02:00:33.030 --> 02:00:34.860
I have always believed that...


02:00:35.630 --> 02:00:39.000
...each one of us definitely has a duty.


02:00:39.640 --> 02:00:43.270
Each and every one has his own
strength and talent.


02:00:43.570 --> 02:00:47.410
And there is a place for him
to display those to the fullest.


02:00:50.210 --> 02:00:55.080
Exactly because of that, people who
were bestowed with talent must exert their best...


02:00:55.590 --> 02:01:01.020
...and display that strength
to the best of his ability.


02:01:08.770 --> 02:01:12.100
I want to be alive... and go back.


02:01:15.510 --> 02:01:17.570
I want to return to my girlfriend's side.


02:01:20.310 --> 02:01:22.040
So you have someone
who's waiting for you huh?


02:01:27.150 --> 02:01:29.420
If so, let's survive and go back together.


02:01:34.490 --> 02:01:38.090
Is it okay for me to follow you too?


02:01:40.560 --> 02:01:44.330
When I'm with you, I have
a feeling that I can make it.


02:01:56.050 --> 02:01:58.070
We have not died.


02:02:00.520 --> 02:02:02.080
If we can get 100 points,


02:02:08.660 --> 02:02:10.630
we can revive...


02:02:12.030 --> 02:02:13.500
...even dead people.


02:02:14.300 --> 02:02:20.060
"100 points menu"
"1. Erase all your memory and get released"
"2. Return the person you love to life "


02:02:22.110 --> 02:02:25.130
That's why, please believe in us,
and together...


02:02:26.280 --> 02:02:27.840
...let us fight.


02:02:29.880 --> 02:02:33.540
"A new morning has come"


02:02:33.820 --> 02:02:37.480
"It's a morning of hope"


02:02:37.760 --> 02:02:41.350
"Open your heart with joy"


02:02:41.630 --> 02:02:45.220
"Look up to the blue sky"


02:02:45.500 --> 02:02:49.230
"Listen to the radio"


02:02:49.500 --> 02:02:53.130
"Take a deep breath"


02:02:53.400 --> 02:02:57.070
"And take in the fragrance
of the wind"


02:02:57.310 --> 02:03:00.940
"And then - one, two, three"


02:03:02.650 --> 02:03:04.010
Let's go.


02:09:39.380 --> 02:09:40.670
Aren't you aware?


02:09:40.840 --> 02:09:43.750
The rumor regarding that black sphere
and the room that contains it?


02:09:43.910 --> 02:09:45.380
You can't use the normal way
to get to that room.


02:09:47.450 --> 02:09:48.750
Something strange is happening to GANTZ.


02:09:48.920 --> 02:09:49.890
Flat battery.


02:09:50.050 --> 02:09:52.540
I was killed by this man.


02:09:53.390 --> 02:09:54.320
Welcome back.


02:09:54.760 --> 02:09:56.090
Kei-chan.


02:09:56.440 --> 02:09:57.520
"At last..."


02:09:57.550 --> 02:09:58.770
"...all the mysteries..."


02:09:58.770 --> 02:10:00.740
"...will be solved."


02:10:00.560 --> 02:10:02.660
Hurry up and transmit us.


02:10:02.700 --> 02:10:03.870
GANTZ!


02:10:07.450 --> 02:10:07.970
"The last alien"


02:10:10.360 --> 02:10:11.030
"The last target"


02:10:14.270 --> 02:10:14.850
"The last battle"


02:10:20.480 --> 02:10:21.470
"What they have got left"


02:10:22.550 --> 02:10:23.390
"[The last choice] is"


02:10:30.180 --> 02:10:32.590
"The ultimate choice is given here"


02:10:32.960 --> 02:10:36.470
Why can't there be no other way than this?


02:10:36.680 --> 02:10:38.100
Witness "the perfect answer"

